WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.175 --> 00:00:01.880
Okay, so AEO,

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.610
GEO and SEO sound like three jobs for my docs,

3
00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:06.820
but they share one goal,

4
00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.732
which is getting a page into an answer.

5
00:00:08.732 --> 00:00:13.247
Google says optimizing for its AI search is still SEO,

6
00:00:13.702 --> 00:00:17.172
so my page needs to be indexed and able to show a snippet,

7
00:00:17.172 --> 00:00:18.807
with no special schema.

8
00:00:18.847 --> 00:00:21.637
What AEO adds is two checks,

9
00:00:21.637 --> 00:00:23.467
and the first is crawler access,

10
00:00:23.467 --> 00:00:26.787
because OpenAI runs separate crawlers for search and training,

11
00:00:26.882 --> 00:00:29.003
so I can allow one and block the other.

12
00:00:29.003 --> 00:00:32.673
The second is that each passage makes sense quoted alone,

13
00:00:32.743 --> 00:00:37.473
so my opening answers the title and each section names its subject.
